# Entrip 개선 항목 실행 계획서

## 📋 Executive Summary
본 문서는 v1→v2 API 마이그레이션 과정에서 발견된 즉시 개선 항목과 중기 개선 항목에 대한 상세 실행 계획입니다.

## 🔴 즉시 개선 항목 (Immediate Improvements)

### 1. Prisma File Lock 문제 근본 해결

#### 1.1 문제 분석
```
현재 상황:
- Windows에서 Prisma 엔진 파일 잠금 오류 지속 발생
- 임시 조치: Prisma generate 단계 우회
- 영향: 스키마 변경 시 타입 불일치 위험
```

#### 1.2 근본 해결 방안

##### Option A: Docker 기반 개발 환경 전환 (권장)
```yaml
# docker-compose.dev.yml
version: '3.8'
services:
  workspace:
    image: node:18-alpine
    volumes:
      - .:/workspace
      - /workspace/node_modules
      - /workspace/.pnpm-store
    working_dir: /workspace
    command: tail -f /dev/null
    environment:
      - PRISMA_ENGINES_MIRROR=https://binaries.prisma.sh
```

**실행 스크립트:**
```powershell
# scripts/dev-docker.ps1
$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"

function Start-DockerDev {
    Write-Host "Starting Docker development environment..." -ForegroundColor Green

    # Docker 실행 확인
    if (!(Get-Process "Docker Desktop" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
        Start-Process "C:\Program Files\Docker\Docker\Docker Desktop.exe"
        Start-Sleep -Seconds 30
    }

    # 개발 컨테이너 시작
    docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d

    # Prisma generate 실행
    docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml exec workspace pnpm prisma:generate

    Write-Host "Development environment ready!" -ForegroundColor Green
}

Start-DockerDev
```

##### Option B: WSL2 기반 개발
```bash
# WSL2 설치 및 설정
wsl --install -d Ubuntu-22.04
wsl --set-version Ubuntu-22.04 2

# WSL2 내부 설정 스크립트
#!/bin/bash
# scripts/setup-wsl.sh

# Node.js 18 설치
curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_18.x | sudo -E bash -
sudo apt-get install -y nodejs

# pnpm 설치
npm install -g pnpm

# 프로젝트 설정
pnpm install
pnpm prisma:generate
```

##### Option C: Prisma Binary 직접 관리
```typescript
// prisma/binary-manager.ts
import { execSync } from 'child_process';
import { platform } from 'os';
import { existsSync, unlinkSync } from 'fs';
import path from 'path';

export class PrismaBinaryManager {
  private static readonly BINARY_PATHS = {
    win32: [
      'node_modules/.prisma/client/query_engine-windows.dll.node',
      'node_modules/@prisma/engines/query_engine-windows.dll.node'
    ]
  };

  static async cleanAndGenerate() {
    if (platform() !== 'win32') return;

    // 기존 바이너리 프로세스 종료
    try {
      execSync('taskkill /F /IM node.exe', { stdio: 'ignore' });
    } catch {}

    // 파일 삭제
    const paths = this.BINARY_PATHS.win32;
    for (const p of paths) {
      if (existsSync(p)) {
        try {
          unlinkSync(p);
          console.log(`Cleaned: ${p}`);
        } catch (error) {
          console.warn(`Could not delete ${p}:`, error);
        }
      }
    }

    // 재생성
    execSync('npx prisma generate', { stdio: 'inherit' });
  }
}
```

#### 1.3 실행 우선순위
1. **즉시 (Day 1)**: Option C 구현 - 빠른 완화책
2. **단기 (Week 1)**: Option A 구현 - Docker 환경 구축
3. **중기 (Month 1)**: 팀 전체 Docker/WSL2 전환

### 2. Docker 개발 환경 표준화

#### 2.1 전체 Docker 환경 구성
```yaml
# docker-compose.full.yml
version: '3.8'

services:
  # PostgreSQL
  postgres:
    image: postgres:15-alpine
    environment:
      POSTGRES_USER: entrip
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: entrip
      POSTGRES_DB: entrip
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    ports:
      - "5432:5432"
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U entrip"]
      interval: 10s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5

  # Redis (캐싱/세션)
  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    ports:
      - "6379:6379"
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "redis-cli", "ping"]
      interval: 10s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5

  # API v1
  api-v1:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: apps/api/Dockerfile
    environment:
      DATABASE_URL: postgresql://entrip:entrip@postgres:5432/entrip
      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379
      NODE_ENV: development
    ports:
      - "4001:4000"
    depends_on:
      postgres:
        condition: service_healthy
      redis:
        condition: service_healthy
    volumes:
      - ./apps/api:/app/apps/api
      - /app/node_modules

  # API v2
  api-v2:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: packages/api/Dockerfile
    environment:
      DATABASE_URL: postgresql://entrip:entrip@postgres:5432/entrip
      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379
      NODE_ENV: development
    ports:
      - "4002:4000"
    depends_on:
      postgres:
        condition: service_healthy
      redis:
        condition: service_healthy
    volumes:
      - ./packages/api:/app/packages/api
      - /app/node_modules

  # Web (Next.js)
  web:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: apps/web/Dockerfile.dev
    environment:
      NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: http://localhost:4001
      API_V2_URL: http://api-v2:4000
      INTERNAL_API_URL: http://api-v1:4000
    ports:
      - "3000:3000"
    depends_on:
      - api-v1
      - api-v2
    volumes:
      - ./apps/web:/app/apps/web
      - ./packages:/app/packages
      - /app/node_modules
      - /app/.next

  # Crawler
  crawler:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: apps/crawler/Dockerfile
    ports:
      - "8001:8001"
    volumes:
      - ./apps/crawler:/app

volumes:
  postgres_data:
```

#### 2.2 개발자 온보딩 스크립트
```powershell
# scripts/dev-setup.ps1
param(
    [string]$Environment = "development"
)

$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"

Write-Host "==================================" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host " Entrip Development Setup " -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host "==================================" -ForegroundColor Cyan

# 1. 필수 도구 확인
function Test-Prerequisites {
    $required = @{
        "Docker" = { docker --version }
        "Node.js" = { node --version }
        "pnpm" = { pnpm --version }
        "Git" = { git --version }
    }

    $missing = @()
    foreach ($tool in $required.Keys) {
        try {
            & $required[$tool] | Out-Null
            Write-Host "✅ $tool installed" -ForegroundColor Green
        } catch {
            Write-Host "❌ $tool missing" -ForegroundColor Red
            $missing += $tool
        }
    }

    if ($missing.Count -gt 0) {
        Write-Host "`nMissing tools: $($missing -join ', ')" -ForegroundColor Red
        Write-Host "Please install missing tools and retry." -ForegroundColor Yellow
        exit 1
    }
}

# 2. 환경 설정 파일 생성
function Setup-Environment {
    Write-Host "`nSetting up environment files..." -ForegroundColor Yellow

    $envFiles = @{
        ".env.local" = @"
NODE_ENV=development
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://entrip:entrip@localhost:5432/entrip
JWT_SECRET=local-dev-secret-change-in-production
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
"@
        "apps/api/.env" = @"
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://entrip:entrip@localhost:5432/entrip
JWT_SECRET=local-dev-secret-change-in-production
PORT=4001
"@
        "packages/api/.env" = @"
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://entrip:entrip@localhost:5432/entrip
JWT_SECRET=local-dev-secret-change-in-production
PORT=4002
"@
        "apps/web/.env.local" = @"
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4001
INTERNAL_API_URL=http://api:4000
"@
    }

    foreach ($file in $envFiles.Keys) {
        $path = Join-Path $PSScriptRoot ".." $file
        if (!(Test-Path $path)) {
            Set-Content -Path $path -Value $envFiles[$file]
            Write-Host "Created $file" -ForegroundColor Green
        }
    }
}

# 3. Docker 환경 시작
function Start-Docker {
    Write-Host "`nStarting Docker services..." -ForegroundColor Yellow

    docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml up -d

    Write-Host "Waiting for services to be healthy..." -ForegroundColor Yellow
    Start-Sleep -Seconds 10

    docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml ps
}

# 4. 데이터베이스 초기화
function Initialize-Database {
    Write-Host "`nInitializing database..." -ForegroundColor Yellow

    # Prisma migrate
    docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml exec api-v1 pnpm prisma:migrate

    # Seed data
    docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml exec api-v1 pnpm prisma:seed

    Write-Host "Database initialized successfully!" -ForegroundColor Green
}

# 5. 실행
Test-Prerequisites
Setup-Environment
Start-Docker
Initialize-Database

Write-Host "`n==================================" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host " Setup Complete! " -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host "==================================" -ForegroundColor Cyan
Write-Host "`nAccess points:" -ForegroundColor Yellow
Write-Host "  Web App: http://localhost:3000" -ForegroundColor White
Write-Host "  API v1: http://localhost:4001" -ForegroundColor White
Write-Host "  API v2: http://localhost:4002" -ForegroundColor White
Write-Host "  Crawler: http://localhost:8001" -ForegroundColor White
Write-Host "`nRun 'pnpm dev' to start development" -ForegroundColor Green
```

## 🟡 중기 개선 항목 (Mid-term Improvements)

### 3. CI/CD 파이프라인 구축

#### 3.1 GitHub Actions 워크플로우
```yaml
# .github/workflows/ci.yml
name: CI Pipeline

on:
  push:
    branches: [main, develop]
  pull_request:
    branches: [main, develop]

jobs:
  # Prisma 생성 및 캐싱
  prisma-generate:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2
        with:
          version: 8

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '18'
          cache: 'pnpm'

      - name: Cache Prisma binaries
        uses: actions/cache@v3
        with:
          path: |
            node_modules/.prisma
            node_modules/@prisma/engines
          key: ${{ runner.os }}-prisma-${{ hashFiles('**/prisma/schema.prisma') }}
          restore-keys: |
            ${{ runner.os }}-prisma-

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Generate Prisma Client
        run: pnpm prisma:generate

      - name: Upload Prisma artifacts
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
        with:
          name: prisma-client
          path: |
            node_modules/.prisma
            packages/api/src/generated

  # 타입 체크
  type-check:
    needs: prisma-generate
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2
        with:
          version: 8

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '18'
          cache: 'pnpm'

      - name: Download Prisma artifacts
        uses: actions/download-artifact@v3
        with:
          name: prisma-client

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Type check
        run: pnpm type-check

  # 린트
  lint:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2
        with:
          version: 8

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '18'
          cache: 'pnpm'

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Lint
        run: pnpm lint

  # 테스트
  test:
    needs: prisma-generate
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    services:
      postgres:
        image: postgres:15
        env:
          POSTGRES_USER: entrip
          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: entrip
          POSTGRES_DB: entrip_test
        options: >-
          --health-cmd pg_isready
          --health-interval 10s
          --health-timeout 5s
          --health-retries 5
        ports:
          - 5432:5432

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2
        with:
          version: 8

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '18'
          cache: 'pnpm'

      - name: Download Prisma artifacts
        uses: actions/download-artifact@v3
        with:
          name: prisma-client

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Setup test database
        run: |
          pnpm prisma:push
          pnpm prisma:seed
        env:
          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://entrip:entrip@localhost:5432/entrip_test

      - name: Run tests
        run: pnpm test
        env:
          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://entrip:entrip@localhost:5432/entrip_test

  # 빌드
  build:
    needs: [type-check, lint, test]
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    strategy:
      matrix:
        app: [web, api, api-v2]

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2
        with:
          version: 8

      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '18'
          cache: 'pnpm'

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

      - name: Build ${{ matrix.app }}
        run: pnpm build --filter=${{ matrix.app }}

      - name: Upload build artifacts
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
        with:
          name: ${{ matrix.app }}-build
          path: |
            apps/*/dist
            apps/*/.next
            packages/*/dist
```

#### 3.2 배포 파이프라인
```yaml
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml
name: Deploy Pipeline

on:
  workflow_run:
    workflows: ["CI Pipeline"]
    types: [completed]
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  deploy-staging:
    if: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.conclusion == 'success' }}
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    environment: staging

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - name: Deploy to staging
        run: |
          echo "Deploying to staging environment"
          # Docker 이미지 빌드 및 푸시
          docker build -t entrip-api:staging .
          docker push ${{ secrets.DOCKER_REGISTRY }}/entrip-api:staging

          # Kubernetes 배포
          kubectl set image deployment/api api=entrip-api:staging
          kubectl rollout status deployment/api

  deploy-production:
    needs: deploy-staging
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    environment: production

    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3

      - name: Run smoke tests on staging
        run: |
          npm run test:e2e -- --env=staging

      - name: Deploy to production
        if: success()
        run: |
          echo "Deploying to production environment"
          # 프로덕션 배포 로직
```

### 4. Windows PowerShell 관리 스크립트

#### 4.1 프로젝트 관리 도구
```powershell
# scripts/entrip.ps1
# Entrip Project Management Tool

param(
    [Parameter(Position=0)]
    [ValidateSet('start', 'stop', 'restart', 'status', 'logs', 'clean', 'reset', 'test', 'migrate')]
    [string]$Command = 'help',

    [Parameter()]
    [ValidateSet('all', 'web', 'api', 'api-v2', 'postgres', 'redis', 'crawler')]
    [string]$Service = 'all',

    [switch]$Docker,
    [switch]$Force
)

$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"

# 색상 출력 헬퍼
function Write-Status {
    param([string]$Message, [string]$Color = "White")
    Write-Host $Message -ForegroundColor $Color
}

# 서비스 상태 확인
function Get-ServiceStatus {
    $services = @{
        "PostgreSQL" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 5432 -Count 1 -Quiet }
        "API v1" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 4001 -Count 1 -Quiet }
        "API v2" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 4002 -Count 1 -Quiet }
        "Web" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 3000 -Count 1 -Quiet }
        "Redis" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 6379 -Count 1 -Quiet }
        "Crawler" = { Test-Connection -ComputerName localhost -Port 8001 -Count 1 -Quiet }
    }

    Write-Status "`n=== Service Status ===" "Cyan"
    foreach ($svc in $services.Keys) {
        $status = & $services[$svc]
        $statusText = if ($status) { "✅ Running" } else { "❌ Stopped" }
        $color = if ($status) { "Green" } else { "Red" }
        Write-Status "$svc : $statusText" $color
    }
}

# 서비스 시작
function Start-Services {
    Write-Status "Starting services..." "Yellow"

    if ($Docker) {
        docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml up -d $Service
    } else {
        # Native 시작
        Start-Process -NoNewWindow -FilePath "pnpm" -ArgumentList "dev:$Service"
    }

    Start-Sleep -Seconds 5
    Get-ServiceStatus
}

# 서비스 중지
function Stop-Services {
    Write-Status "Stopping services..." "Yellow"

    if ($Docker) {
        docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml stop $Service
    } else {
        # Node 프로세스 종료
        Get-Process -Name node -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force
    }

    Write-Status "Services stopped" "Green"
}

# 로그 보기
function Show-Logs {
    if ($Docker) {
        docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml logs -f $Service
    } else {
        Get-Content -Path "logs/*.log" -Tail 50 -Wait
    }
}

# 클린업
function Clean-Project {
    Write-Status "Cleaning project..." "Yellow"

    $targets = @(
        "node_modules",
        ".next",
        "dist",
        ".turbo",
        "coverage",
        "*.log"
    )

    foreach ($target in $targets) {
        Get-ChildItem -Path . -Include $target -Recurse -Force | Remove-Item -Recurse -Force
        Write-Status "Cleaned: $target" "Green"
    }

    if ($Docker) {
        docker-compose -f docker-compose.full.yml down -v
        Write-Status "Docker volumes cleaned" "Green"
    }
}

# 데이터베이스 마이그레이션
function Run-Migration {
    Write-Status "Running database migration..." "Yellow"

    pnpm prisma:migrate
    pnpm prisma:generate
    pnpm prisma:seed

    Write-Status "Migration complete!" "Green"
}

# 테스트 실행
function Run-Tests {
    Write-Status "Running tests..." "Yellow"

    $testSuites = @{
        "Unit" = "test:unit"
        "Integration" = "test:integration"
        "E2E" = "test:e2e"
        "Contract" = "test:contract"
    }

    foreach ($suite in $testSuites.Keys) {
        Write-Status "`nRunning $suite tests..." "Cyan"
        pnpm $testSuites[$suite]
    }
}

# 메인 실행
switch ($Command) {
    'start' { Start-Services }
    'stop' { Stop-Services }
    'restart' { Stop-Services; Start-Services }
    'status' { Get-ServiceStatus }
    'logs' { Show-Logs }
    'clean' { Clean-Project }
    'reset' { Clean-Project; pnpm install; Run-Migration; Start-Services }
    'test' { Run-Tests }
    'migrate' { Run-Migration }
    default {
        Write-Status @"
Entrip Project Management Tool

Usage: .\entrip.ps1 [command] [options]

Commands:
  start     Start services
  stop      Stop services
  restart   Restart services
  status    Show service status
  logs      Show logs
  clean     Clean project files
  reset     Full reset (clean + install + migrate)
  test      Run tests
  migrate   Run database migrations

Options:
  -Service  [all|web|api|api-v2|postgres|redis|crawler]
  -Docker   Use Docker instead of native
  -Force    Force operation

Examples:
  .\entrip.ps1 start -Docker
  .\entrip.ps1 logs -Service api
  .\entrip.ps1 reset -Force
"@ "Cyan"
    }
}
```

### 5. 환경별 설정 관리

#### 5.1 설정 구조
```typescript
// packages/shared/src/config/index.ts
export interface EnvironmentConfig {
  name: 'development' | 'staging' | 'production';
  api: {
    v1: { url: string; timeout: number; };
    v2: { url: string; timeout: number; };
    migrationPhase: number;
  };
  database: {
    url: string;
    poolMin: number;
    poolMax: number;
  };
  redis: {
    url: string;
    ttl: number;
  };
  features: {
    useV2Auth: boolean;
    useV2Bookings: boolean;
    useWebSocket: boolean;
    useCache: boolean;
  };
  monitoring: {
    enabled: boolean;
    sampleRate: number;
  };
}

// 환경별 설정
const configs: Record<string, EnvironmentConfig> = {
  development: {
    name: 'development',
    api: {
      v1: { url: 'http://localhost:4001', timeout: 30000 },
      v2: { url: 'http://localhost:4002', timeout: 30000 },
      migrationPhase: 2
    },
    database: {
      url: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,
      poolMin: 2,
      poolMax: 10
    },
    redis: {
      url: process.env.REDIS_URL || 'redis://localhost:6379',
      ttl: 3600
    },
    features: {
      useV2Auth: true,
      useV2Bookings: false,
      useWebSocket: true,
      useCache: false
    },
    monitoring: {
      enabled: false,
      sampleRate: 1.0
    }
  },

  staging: {
    name: 'staging',
    api: {
      v1: { url: 'https://staging-api.entrip.com', timeout: 10000 },
      v2: { url: 'https://staging-api-v2.entrip.com', timeout: 10000 },
      migrationPhase: 3
    },
    database: {
      url: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,
      poolMin: 5,
      poolMax: 20
    },
    redis: {
      url: process.env.REDIS_URL!,
      ttl: 7200
    },
    features: {
      useV2Auth: true,
      useV2Bookings: true,
      useWebSocket: true,
      useCache: true
    },
    monitoring: {
      enabled: true,
      sampleRate: 0.1
    }
  },

  production: {
    name: 'production',
    api: {
      v1: { url: 'https://api.entrip.com', timeout: 5000 },
      v2: { url: 'https://api-v2.entrip.com', timeout: 5000 },
      migrationPhase: 1
    },
    database: {
      url: process.env.DATABASE_URL!,
      poolMin: 10,
      poolMax: 30
    },
    redis: {
      url: process.env.REDIS_URL!,
      ttl: 86400
    },
    features: {
      useV2Auth: false,
      useV2Bookings: false,
      useWebSocket: true,
      useCache: true
    },
    monitoring: {
      enabled: true,
      sampleRate: 0.01
    }
  }
};

export function getConfig(): EnvironmentConfig {
  const env = process.env.NODE_ENV || 'development';
  return configs[env] || configs.development;
}
```

#### 5.2 Feature Flag 시스템
```typescript
// packages/shared/src/features/flags.ts
export class FeatureFlags {
  private static config = getConfig();

  static isEnabled(feature: keyof EnvironmentConfig['features']): boolean {
    return this.config.features[feature];
  }

  static getMigrationPhase(): number {
    return this.config.api.migrationPhase;
  }

  static shouldUseV2(endpoint: string): boolean {
    const phase = this.getMigrationPhase();
    const v2Endpoints = {
      1: ['/api/health'],
      2: ['/api/health', '/api/auth'],
      3: ['/api/health', '/api/auth', '/api/bookings'],
      4: ['*'] // 모든 엔드포인트
    };

    const allowedEndpoints = v2Endpoints[phase] || [];
    return allowedEndpoints.includes('*') || allowedEndpoints.includes(endpoint);
  }
}
```

